Bundled third-party sources
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The plugin bundles source files from Psalm and PHPStan so that a keyword's
definition can be opened even when the project has neither installed. They are
read-only copies, used for navigation and for the descriptions shown on hover.
Where a project has its own copy under vendor/, that one is opened instead.

